# .dockerignore — trims the build context sent to the Docker daemon.
# Smaller context = faster builds. Anything an image needs is either copied
# explicitly by its Dockerfile or reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image.
#
# NOTE: this file is shared by EVERY image built from the repo root
# (lanime-web AND poker-server). So it must NOT exclude any packages/* source —
# only dependencies, build outputs, secrets, and local junk.

# Dependencies — reinstalled inside the image via pnpm
**/node_modules

# Build outputs — rebuilt inside the image (never ship stale host artifacts)
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/.cache

# VCS / editor / OS junk
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets & local env — injected at runtime, never baked into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local data / databases / logs
**/data
*.db
*.db-*
*.log

# Platform & tooling metadata not needed to build
.vercel
.workman
.claude
